  "description": "Parahumans. Nectar. Aetherol. These things have changed the world in short order, none more so than parahumans. Their unimaginable power makes them the top priority of every organization, legitimate or otherwise, all over the world. Even so, Geon Yoo couldn’t have predicted the situation he was coming home to. Having killed his parents in pursuit of his sister, it’s clear the Seven Star Syndicate will stop at nothing to get what they want from her. It’s their bad luck that they made it personal.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
